{"id":"n65003-1-6","stage":4,"title":"숙식 · 食宿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65003-1-6-1","ko":"요즘은 어디서 지내고 있으세요?","zh":"最近您住在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내고","audio":"/audio/105243a4d294469934cc.mp3"}},{"text":"있으세요?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으세요","audio":"/audio/7d2bbaaa76284e5bcb4e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/781e8a731d86c56e45c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65003-1-6-2","ko":"친구 집에서 임시로 숙식을 하고 있어요.","zh":"我暂时住在朋友家，吃住都在那儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"임시로","meaning":"临时","explanation":"임시：临时；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"임시","audio":"/audio/7fc3fbe72544ffea90a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70790","senseId":"1","lemma":"임시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"임시로","audio":"/audio/922cacc6318acf174b55.mp3"}},{"text":"숙식을","meaning":"食宿","explanation":"숙식：食宿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙식","audio":"/audio/a9ebf2111855586cbc34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65003","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙식을","audio":"/audio/5e1579610c09c93478b2.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"进行某事（숙식을 하다：吃住、食宿）","explanation":"하다：进行某事（숙식을 하다：吃住、食宿）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"7fc3fbe72544ffea","term":"임시","zh":"临时","audio":"/audio/7fc3fbe72544ffea90a4.mp3","entryId":"70790","definition":"没有提前确定，根据当时的需求而定。","pronunciation":["임시"]},{"id":"a9ebf2111855586c","term":"숙식","zh":"食宿","audio":"/audio/a9ebf2111855586cbc34.mp3","entryId":"65003","definition":"睡觉并吃饭。","pronunciation":["숙씩"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"进行某事（숙식을 하다：吃住、食宿）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某事（숙식을 하다：吃住、食宿）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7cbe321a72ec2cc8e22.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65003","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我暂时住在朋友家，吃住都在那儿。","最近您住在哪儿呢？","怎么这么早就回家了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近您住在哪儿呢？","怎么这么早就回家了？","我暂时住在朋友家，吃住都在那儿。"],"answer":2}]}
